  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nsqrt{625} + sqrt{(625)/(100)} + sqrt{(625)/(10000)} + sqrt{(625)/(1000000)}\n\n**Formula used:**\n\nsqrt{a} + (sqrt{(a)/(b)}) + sqrt{(a)/(b²)} + sqrt{(a)/(b³)}\n\n**Calculation:**\n\nsqrt{625} = 25\n\nsqrt{(625)/(100)} = sqrt{6.25} = 2.5\n\nsqrt{(625)/(10000)} = sqrt{0.0625} = 0.25\n\nsqrt{(625)/(1000000)} = sqrt{0.00625} = 0.025\n\n⇒ 25 + 2.5 + 0.25 + 0.025\n\n⇒ 27.775\n\n**∴ The value is 27.775**",
